      "location": {
        "uuid": "d23b232c-529b-4408-9a10-602ab79c548a",
        "name": "Primary"
      },
      "report": "<p>Thanks for a great summer!&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mt. Bachelor is now closed for the season</strong> and the slopes are uncontrolled and unpatrolled. Biking on Mt. Bachelor trails is NOT allowed during this time. Hikers should call 911 in the case of an emergency. Please stay away from equipment, crews at work, and infrastructure.</p><p>Mt. Bachelor is scheduled to open for the 26/27 winter season on <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/winter-opening-day/\">December 4</a>, conditions permitting. As always, we are committed to opening early if snowfall and conditions allow!</p><p>Mountain Gateway reopens October 31 and will be open every weekend through Opening Day on December 4. Stop by Mt. Bachelor Sports Pro Shop, featuring the PNW\u2019s largest selection of premium ski and snowboard gear, great deals, and expert advice. Check or pick up your Season Pass at one of our PUBs, and pick up your Seasonal Rentals on the second floor.</p>",
